{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p003751","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p003751"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p003751","label":"韓王（老韓列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"韓王","mention_ids":["c-shiji-063-laohan:m013-0011","c-shiji-063-laohan:m013-0014","c-shiji-063-laohan:m024-0066"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:m013-0011","chapter_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:p013","quote":"韓王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:m013-0014","chapter_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:p013","quote":"韓王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:m024-0066","chapter_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:p024","quote":"韓王"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:m013-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"韓王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003751","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:p013","chapter_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan"},{"id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:m013-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"韓王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003751","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:p013","chapter_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan"},{"id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:m024-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"韓王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003751","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:p024","chapter_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji063-021","person_id":"cbr-p003751","title":"韓王","kind":"royal_rank","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan","source_id":"s-shiji-063-laohan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:p024","quote":"人或傳其書至秦。秦王見《孤憤》、《五蠹》之書，曰：「嗟乎，寡人得見此人與之游，死不恨矣！」李斯曰：「此韓非之所著書也。」秦因急攻韓。韓王始不用非，及急，乃遣非使秦。秦王悅之，未信用。李斯、姚賈害之，毀之曰：「韓非，韓之諸公子也。今王欲并諸侯，非終為韓不為秦，此人之情也。今王不用，久留而歸之，此自遺患也，不如以過法誅之。」秦王以為然，下吏治非。李斯使人遺非藥，使自殺。韓非欲自陳，不得見。秦王後悔之，使人赦之，非已死矣。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji063-021:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:p024","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"韓王","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:m024-0066","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"依來源用稱保存，公號與帝稱不當生前已授同字諡稱；引例保留敘事範圍，不據首次用稱或死亡補任期。制度未定用稱保留未分類。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji063-032","person_id":"cbr-p003751","surfaces":["韓王"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-063-laohan"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:p013","quote":"非見韓之削弱，數以書諫韓王，韓王不能用。於是韓非疾治國不務修明其法制，執勢以御其臣下，富國彊兵而以求人任賢，反舉浮淫之蠹而加之於功實之上。以為儒者用文亂法，而俠者以武犯禁。寬則寵名譽之人，急則用介胄之士。今者所養非所用，所用非所養。悲廉直不容於邪枉之臣，觀往者得失之變，故作《孤憤》、《五蠹》、《內外儲》、《說林》、《說難》十餘萬言。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:p024","quote":"人或傳其書至秦。秦王見《孤憤》、《五蠹》之書，曰：「嗟乎，寡人得見此人與之游，死不恨矣！」李斯曰：「此韓非之所著書也。」秦因急攻韓。韓王始不用非，及急，乃遣非使秦。秦王悅之，未信用。李斯、姚賈害之，毀之曰：「韓非，韓之諸公子也。今王欲并諸侯，非終為韓不為秦，此人之情也。今王不用，久留而歸之，此自遺患也，不如以過法誅之。」秦王以為然，下吏治非。李斯使人遺非藥，使自殺。韓非欲自陳，不得見。秦王後悔之，使人赦之，非已死矣。"}],"rationale":"依開篇姓名與敘事局部短稱暫接，未名引例人物不補名。老萊子及太史儋與老子分候選不表示確定不同，書名與否定非字不當人物提及，故事與身份確證分開。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:p013","text":"非見韓之削弱，數以書諫韓王，韓王不能用。於是韓非疾治國不務修明其法制，執勢以御其臣下，富國彊兵而以求人任賢，反舉浮淫之蠹而加之於功實之上。以為儒者用文亂法，而俠者以武犯禁。寬則寵名譽之人，急則用介胄之士。今者所養非所用，所用非所養。悲廉直不容於邪枉之臣，觀往者得失之變，故作《孤憤》、《五蠹》、《內外儲》、《說林》、《說難》十餘萬言。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:m013-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"非","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003739","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:m013-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"韓王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003751","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:m013-0014","